WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.110
During development we often need to run Python

2
00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:08.320
PowerShell or batch scripts which usually meant opening terminals

3
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.980
navigating directories or elevating permissions manually

4
00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.860
So I built this Context Menu Script Runner

5
00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.680
integrated directly into Antigravity IDE

6
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:23.900
Right-click in explorer or editor to run scripts with 1-click

7
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:27.200
It supports auto-saving before running Python scripts

8
00:00:27.540 --> 00:00:29.360
automatically aligns CWD for batch files

9
00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:32.620
and bypasses execution policy for PowerShell

10
00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:37.840
with Run-as-Admin support and keeping windows open

11
00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:41.660
making script testing and debugging super smooth
